export anchor FintechStyle:
    number: 184
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Fintech
    idea: A crisp banking grade ledger, deep green and white with precise tabular figures, hairline dividers and nothing decorative, so every number reads as trustworthy.
    base: light
    palette:
        deepGreen: #0b4d3a, the 3px header top rule, the full width summary band, the primary button, the this week line and focus
        green2: #0f6a4f, links and the thin progress fills
        mint: #cfe8dd, labels and captions on the green band and the focus halo
        white: #ffffff, the header, panels, fields and the overdue chip on the band
        page: #f6f8f7, the page background
        ink: #0f1d17, text and figures
        muted: #4a5a53, column heads, meta, axis labels and timestamps
        rule: #dfe5e2, row and panel hairlines and empty bar tracks
        ruleStrong: #c3ccc8, table head rules, field borders and the chart baseline
        onTrack: #0b6b45, the On track word with a filled circle
        atRisk: #8a5300, the At risk word with a filled triangle
        behind: #b42318, the Behind word with a filled square and the overdue chip
    type:
        One stack, system-ui, apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, with tabular lining numerals on the whole page. KPI
        figures are 32px at 600 and minus 0.02em, the greeting 26px at 650,
        panel titles 15px at 650, table and activity text 13px, column
        heads and band labels 11 to 12px caps at 600 tracked 0.04 to
        0.06em.
    layout:
        A white header with a 3px deep green top rule holds the brand mark
        and name, the six nav links inline with a 2px green underline on
        Home, then at the right a search field, a green New project button,
        a square bell with a red dot and the initials disc with Mara Okafor.
        Under it a full width deep green band carries a caps dateline, the
        greeting and a small white chip reading 4 tasks are overdue with a
        red square, then a row of four KPI figures in white split by thin
        translucent vertical dividers, each with a mint caps label above
        and a small caption below, such as 78 of 170 tasks done. The main
        area is a two to one grid. The wide left panel is a projects ledger
        table sorted by due date with columns Project with team below,
        Progress as a thin bar and percent, Tasks as 18 / 25, Due, Days
        left and Status, closed by a Total row of 46 percent and 78 / 170.
        The right panel is an activity ledger with the action on one line,
        the project below in muted text and the time right aligned. Below
        both, a full width chart panel has a stats column at left with This
        week 73, Last week 59, Change plus 14 at plus 23.7 percent in green
        and Daily average 10.4 against 8.4, and at right a line chart that
        overlays the two weeks on a Sunday to Saturday axis, last week as a
        dashed grey line and this week as a solid green line with hollow
        points and a faint green area. Below 1000px the grid stacks. Below
        720px the nav wraps onto its own row under the brand, the search
        hides, KPIs go two by two, the stats sit in two columns above the
        chart, and the table and chart scroll sideways inside their panels.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px page gutters and gaps, 16px panel padding, table cells 10px by 12px.
    density: Medium high. Projects are a ledger table rather than cards.
    corners: 4px on panels, buttons, fields and chips. Bars 2px. The avatar is round.
    borders: 1px hairlines between every row and around panels, a stronger line under table heads, and a 3px deep green rule on top of the header.
    shadows: None. Structure comes from rules alone.
    icons:
        16px line icons at 1.6 stroke for search, plus and bell. Status
        uses solid 10px shapes, a circle for On track, a triangle for At
        risk and a square for Behind, always beside the word.
    focus: A 2px deep green outline offset 2px with a 4px mint halo. A focused field gets a deep green border and outline.
    tone: Exact and neutral, figures first, such as Due this week, Days left and Change plus 14.
